Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:31:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] local: sessions and sign-out work with erssi

The server in erssi mode never answered "sessions:get", "sign-out" or
anything about sessions: the settings page showed an empty session list,
there was no way to sign out, and every page load - also a reload with the
stored token - created a new session whose token stayed valid forever
(93 sessions on one account in two days).

- A browser that signs in with its stored token keeps that session; only
  a password sign-in creates a new one.
- sessions:get lists the sessions (current, active browsers, last use);
  sign-out ends the asking browser's session or a chosen one, and every
  browser using it goes back to the sign-in page.
- "Sign out all other sessions" on the account page.
- Sessions unused for 30 days expire.
- A sign-out button in the sidebar footer.
